{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934550/extras/8621f6e74c7188e54c7583820816cf8e.poster.avif?t=1754766618\" width=450 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934550/extras/8621f6e74c7188e54c7583820816cf8e.webm?t=1754766618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934550/extras/8621f6e74c7188e54c7583820816cf8e.mp4?t=1754766618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch worlds. Dodge traps. Collect disks. Beat the clock.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add DualVerse86 to your wishlist now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934550/extras/ec786ef60c57d560f5d540de55a38d8c.poster.avif?t=1754766618\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934550/extras/ec786ef60c57d560f5d540de55a38d8c.webm?t=1754766618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934550/extras/ec786ef60c57d560f5d540de55a38d8c.mp4?t=1754766618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DualVerse86 is a 2D retro-futuristic parkour game where every level is a race against time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch in real-time between two virtual worlds to dodge traps, clear platforms, grab floppy disks, and beat the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fast and precise gameplay, a visual style inspired by the 90s, and a driving synthwave soundtrack, DualVerse86 is your next obsession if you love speedrunning, technical challenges, and unforgiving games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo includes the first 4 levels</strong>, featuring core mechanics and early platform variations like disappearing tiles, auto-switch triggers, slow-down zones, and trampolines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just enough to give you a taste... but enough to spark an obsession.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934550/extras/7ebfabff8608220b558cd119bcacbf63.poster.avif?t=1754766618\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934550/extras/7ebfabff8608220b558cd119bcacbf63.webm?t=1754766618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934550/extras/7ebfabff8608220b558cd119bcacbf63.mp4?t=1754766618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key gameplay features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise 2D platforming mixed with fast-paced parkour, set in a retro atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly switch between two worlds to overcome obstacles and traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect floppy disks to unlock new levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based challenges with medals to earn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets to discover in every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focused on movement, timing, and precision, no combat involved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synthwave soundtrack for full immersion in the 80s vibe.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The clock is ticking. Get ready. Add it to your wishlist!</strong></p>","background":"https://store